     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"\\frac{4}{{\\sqrt 7 }}\"></span></p>\n<p>Multiply the numerator and denominator by <span data-math=\"\\sqrt 7 \"></span>.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\frac{{4 \\times \\sqrt 7 }}{{\\sqrt 7  \\times \\sqrt 7 }}\"></span></p>\n<p>Simplify.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\frac{{4\\sqrt 7 }}{7}\"></span></p>\n<p><b><i>Section 3.5 Exercises</i></b></p>"
